#. module: l10n_ca_nt_payroll
#: model:l10n_ca.payroll.source,summary:l10n_ca_nt_payroll.source_payroll_tax_act
msgid ""
"Every employee pays a tax of 2% of the remuneration paid in the year, which "
"the employer withholds from the remuneration. Remuneration: the employment "
"income under s. 5(1), 6 and 7 of the Income Tax Act, except a pension paid "
"after retirement and the amounts deductible under s. 8(1)(c) or 110(2) of "
"that Act. An employee who normally works outside the territory owes the tax "
"on the days worked in it."
msgstr ""

