#. module: l10n_ca_nt_payroll
#: model:l10n_ca.payroll.source,summary:l10n_ca_nt_payroll.source_payroll_tax_regulations
msgid ""
"Prescribed amount of 5,000: an employee who normally works outside the "
"territory owes no tax when the remuneration from the employer in the year "
"does not exceed it. Remittance by the 20th day of the month after the "
"reporting period; annual return by February 28."
msgstr ""

#. module: l10n_ca_nt_payroll
#: model:l10n_ca.payroll.source,summary:l10n_ca_nt_payroll.source_finance_payroll_tax
msgid ""
"Remuneration subject to the payroll tax: salaries and wages, bonuses, "
"gratuities, commissions and honoraria, vacation travel assistance, stock "
"options, taxable allowances and benefits, employer RRSP contributions, "
"retiring allowances. Registration within 21 days of the first pay. Reporting"
" period by the estimated payroll of the year: monthly above 1,000,000, "
"quarterly above 600,000, semi-annual above 200,000, annual otherwise, "
"monthly during the season for a seasonal employer. Remittance return, even "
"nil, by the 20th day of the month after the period; annual return by "
"February 28."
msgstr ""

